  "headline": "Bivalirudin supply at Corvale sites shows 31 days at Corvale East and 13 days at Corvale General; the Dr. Reddy's label lists Gland Pharma Limited as the manufacturing plant with a VAI inspection on 2024-07-25",
  "headline_cites": ["D1", "D2", "E9", "E8"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 270 units of bivalirudin with a daily use of 8.8 units, providing 31 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 137 units with a daily use of 10.7 units, providing 13 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label for NDC 55111065237 identifies Gland Pharma Limited as the manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for Gland Pharma Limited (FEI 3002647489) show a Voluntary Action Indicated classification from the most recent inspection ending 2024-07-25.",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Previous inspections of the same facility in 2012, 2015, 2017, 2019, and 2023 also resulted in VAI classifications.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4", "E5", "E6", "E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bivalirudin is not on the FDA drug shortage list as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Verify current allocation status with Accord Healthcare, Inc., the recommended supplier, and confirm whether the Dr. Reddy's product remains available for ordering.",
      "cites": []
    }
  ]
}
